<Layout title="Visit the gallery"><section class="wrap page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">551 MAIN STREET · HARWICH PORT</p><h1>The gallery<br/><em>down the alley.</em></h1><p class="lede">Original paintings, a warm welcome, and an artist ready to share the stories behind the work.</p></section><section class="wrap detail-grid visit-details"><img src={localUrl('/images/gallery.jpg')} alt="Original paintings on the walls of the Guild’s Art Gallery"/><div><h2>Make a little time for art.</h2><p>Our seasonal gallery features 22 juried local artists working in a variety of media. A rotating group of gallery artists welcomes visitors.</p><dl><dt>Find us</dt><dd>551 Main Street (Route 28)<br/>Harwich Port, MA 02646<br/>Free parking across the street.</dd><dt>Seasonal hours</dt><dd>Fall weekends, 11 am–4 pm, through mid-December, according to the Guild’s published seasonal schedule. Please call before traveling; hours may change.</dd><dt>Call the gallery</dt><dd><a href="tel:+15084321012">(508) 432-1012</a></dd></dl><a class="button" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Guild+of+Harwich+Artists+551+Main+Street+Harwich+Port+MA">Get directions <span>↗</span></a><p class="note"><a href="https://guildofharwichartists.org/art-gallery/">View the Guild’s current gallery information ↗</a></p></div></section></Layout>
